(The PostmarkEscrow contract has several high-risk issues including missing access controls on critical functions,) Tj
T* (potential integer overflows in credit management, and vulnerabilities related to front-running in the claim process.) Tj
T* (There are also medium-risk concerns regarding unchecked return values from external precompiles and potential) Tj
T* (gas exhaustion from unbounded loops. The contract implements ReentrancyGuard but lacks proper access control) Tj
T* (for some functions, making it vulnerable to manipulation by unauthorized parties.) Tj
